                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Senate Republicans just unveiled their tax scam bill \u2013 and it\u2019s even more extreme than the House version. It slashes Medicaid and the ACA, rips health care from the most vulnerable, forces rural hospitals to close, and puts lives at risk.\n\u00a0\n@SenateDems \u2013 and the American people \u2013 will stand up to protect Americans\u2019 health care.",
