                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I joined @SenateDems to strengthen Medicaid and crack down on fraud \u2013 while Republicans push cuts that would rip health care from millions and force rural hospital closures.\n \nMy bill delivers emergency funding for home health care, personal care, and critical support for our seniors.",
