                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "\"They'll get over it.\"? Folks who depend on Medicaid for health care coverage will suffer if the Republicans pass their budget bill to gut Medicaid. Trust me, they will not get over it, nor should they have to.",
