                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Americans may be seeing today's news of Senate Republicans trying to set up a so-called stabilization fund for rural hospitals.\n\nThis is an acknowledgment by my Republican colleagues that their cuts to Medicaid will decimate rural hospitals and health care providers. Senate Democrats are fighting for your care, while Senate Republicans are fighting to give tax cuts to billionaires.",
