                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This morning, the Senate Parliamentarian ruled against some of the deep cuts Republicans are trying to make to Medicaid. But the fight is not over. They will continue to wage war on the program and take every last cent possible to give to the ultra-wealthy.",
                "text_lang": "en",
