                "quoted_status_profile_username": "BBKogan",
                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Congressional Republicans just passed a bill that adds $3.4 TRILLION to the debt.\n \n\u2013 The largest Medicaid cut in history, kicking millions off their health insurance\n\u2013 The deepest SNAP cut ever, slashing food assistance for hungry kids and families\n\u2013 All to hand billionaires another massive tax break\n \nAnd they did it while costs are rising and inflation is up under the Trump administration.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1753205633,
                "view_count": 1041
            },
            {
