                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Hospital leaders from across Northern New Mexico are sounding the alarm: Republican-led cuts to Medicaid and Medicare threaten their ability to provide care. I\u2019m fighting to reverse the these cuts, keep rural hospitals open, and protect access to health care for every New Mexican.",
